Sun Oct 18 13:36:21 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- New package, version 4.6.11:
  * SIMD-accelerated JSON parser (libsimdjson33 shared library plus
    -devel with headers, CMake config and pkgconfig file).
  * Version choice: latest 4.6.x, same API line and SOVERSION
    33 as the v4.6.4 that science/apache-arrow bundles; arrow
    26.0 accepts any SYSTEM simdjson >= 4.3.0, and 4.6.11
    carries upstream's audit fixes.
  * Upstream's own test suite needs network fetches (CPM),
    so %check runs a small parse smoke test against the
    built library instead.

